{"law":"花蓮縣-GL001568","name":"花蓮縣迅行及策略性更新地區建築物高度及建蔽率放寬標準","region":"花蓮縣","source":"https://glrs.hl.gov.tw/glrsout/LawContentHistoryList.aspx?id=GL001568","note":"歷次版本取自該縣市法規系統「歷史法規」；promulgated 是異動（發布）日期。施行日：自治法規依地方制度法第 32 條為發布日起算第三日，條文定有日期者依其日期；行政規則（要點、原則等）未明定者不推定（effectiveKnown=false）。無法切分條號的舊版只存 fullText。","currentPromulgated":null,"currentHash":"f39c8b26c9b826e0d7b9e257b6ce42d6b525825327356c20a4ff8b31f4aa3eb8","texts":{"80f9e1ecfb89ac27":"本標準依都市更新條例(以下簡稱本條例)第六十五條第四項規定訂定之。","a20b5bda8736b307":"本標準之主管機關為花蓮縣政府。","fb1fc1e6eabbda40":"本標準適用範圍為依本條例第七條、第八條劃定或變更之迅行及策略性更新地區。","74dea5e0582d5019":"更新單元放寬建蔽率，土地使用分區以住宅區為限，且不得超過原建蔽率。","5f2b9b4f93cffc16":"更新單元之建築物高度，除飛航安全管制及軍事管制外，不受建築法令及都市計\n\n        畫法令之建築高度限制。","0760487a7e1a3f98":"本標準自發布日施行。"},"versions":[{"promulgated":null,"url":"https://glrs.hl.gov.tw/glrsout/LawContent.aspx?id=GL001568","effective":null,"effectiveKnown":false,"effectiveBasis":"無發布日期","exceptions":{},"current":true,"changed":{"第 一 條":"80f9e1ecfb89ac27","第 二 條":"a20b5bda8736b307","第 三 條":"fb1fc1e6eabbda40","第 四 條":"74dea5e0582d5019","第 五 條":"5f2b9b4f93cffc16","第 六 條":"0760487a7e1a3f98"},"removed":[],"articleOrder":["第 一 條","第 二 條","第 三 條","第 四 條","第 五 條","第 六 條"],"articleCount":6}],"articles":{"第 一 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"80f9e1ecfb89ac27","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 二 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"a20b5bda8736b307","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 三 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"fb1fc1e6eabbda40","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 四 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"74dea5e0582d5019","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 五 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"5f2b9b4f93cffc16","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第 六 條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"0760487a7e1a3f98","version":null,"promulgated":null}]}}
